# Minecraft Forge 1.8.9 requires JDK 8.
#
# This repository intentionally does NOT commit a gradle.properties file,
# because machine-specific settings (like JDK paths) should stay local.
#
# Recommended way to provide JDK 8 (no file needed):
#   Set the JAVA_HOME environment variable to a JDK 8 installation
#   before running ./gradlew (Windows: set JAVA_HOME=... or use setx).
#
# Alternative: copy this file to gradle.properties and uncomment the
# line below, filling in YOUR OWN JDK 8 path:
#
# org.gradle.java.home=/path/to/your/jdk8
